  "description": "基于 RaTeX（纯 Rust 的 KaTeX 兼容引擎）的 uni-app x 数学公式渲染组件：App 端走原生 .so + Canvas（无 WebView），H5/小程序走 WASM + Canvas 2D。输入标准 LaTeX 语法，与 KaTeX 风格一致，最终目标为全平台统一替换 KaTeX。",
  "keywords": [
    "uniapp-x",
    "ratex",
    "rust",
    "latex",
    "数学公式",
    "公式渲染",
    "math",
    "native",
    "wasm",
    "katex-replacement"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "HBuilderX": "^4.07",
    "uni-app-x": "^4.07"
  },
